<title>UK: Royal Bank raises UK base rate to 6.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank raises UK base rate to 6.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Bank of Scotland said on Thursday it has raised its UK bank base rate by 25 basis points to 6.75 percent.</p>
<p>The move follows the Bank of England's decision to raise official rates to 6.75 percent from 6.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
